                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone h='7024' id='3463' name='jira' show-title='false' w='3968' x='95397' y='615'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone h='91746' id='3524' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98730' x='635' y='7639'>
            <zone fixed-size='223' h='17154' id='3541' is-fixed='true' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98730' x='635' y='7639'>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='17154' id='3526' type-v2='text' w='98730' x='635' y='7639'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontsize='10'>Seagull data is obtained using an</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#cb011c' fontsize='10'>external provider</run>
                  <run fontsize='10'>, who manages an app which allows them to scrape e-mails from their customers.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontsize='10'>When orders are placed and</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontsize='10'>Æ </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#cb011c' fontsize='10'>e-mails receipts</run>
                  <run fontsize='10'> are sent, the provider reads these messages and gathers all </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#cb011c' fontsize='10'>available information</run>
                  <run fontsize='10'> such as vendor name, location, order value and so on. Not all receipts are standardized, therefore some information may not be available for all competitors.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontsize='10'>We receive this information on a </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#cb011c' fontsize='10'>weekly basis</run>
                  <run fontsize='10'> and this is our sample data. We apply </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#cb011c' fontsize='10'>statistical techniques</run>
                  <run fontsize='10'> on it and </run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#cb011c' fontsize='10'>infer the metrics</run>
                  <run fontsize='10'> for our competitors.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontsize='10'>If you think about the sample as a pizza slice, we use all the information available in that specific slice to try to create what the entire pizza looks like. The smaller the slice, the harder the inference because we might have some ingredient missing or the proportion each ingredient might not be correct.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
            </zone>
            <zone fixed-size='395' h='31000' id='3539' is-centered='0' is-fixed='true' is-scaled='1' param='Image/Screenshot 2023-04-14 at 12.39.29.png' type-v2='bitmap' w='98730' x='635' y='24793'>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone forceUpdate='true' h='28923' id='3877' type-v2='text' w='98730' x='635' y='55793'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>Below we listed the main KPI&apos;s created by the methodology previously mentioned:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>Incentivised Orders</run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>: Number of orders placed that included a financial incentive (promotion, discount).</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>Non-Incentivised Orders</run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>: Number of orders placed without any financial incentives (promotion, discount).</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>Incentivised GMV</run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>: Amount of GMV generated from orders that included financial incentives (promotion, discount).</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>Non-Incentivised GMV</run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>: Amount of GMV generated from orders without financial incentives (promotion, discount).</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>Average Food Value</run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'> (AFV): AFV displayed for competitor brands represents the “subtotal” on consumers’ e-receipts. AFV displayed for DH brands aligns with the DH-internal AFV definition (Gross Food Value / # of Orders, whereas Gross Food Value (GFV) is the total paid compulsory by customer for food, excluding service fees and delivery fees, but including VAT).</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>Incentive Share</run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>: The percentage of orders, out of the total orders, that included a financial incentive (promotion, discount).</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>Frequency</run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>: Customers’ order frequency within a given month or week.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>Live Customers</run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>: Customers that are currently opted-in as panelists. Non live customers&apos; historic transactions (up to the day they opted out of the panel) will still be shown.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>Live Transactions</run>
                <run fontcolor='#555555' fontsize='10'>: Transactions made by Live Customers.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
